{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>***PLEASE READ BEFORE PURCHASING</strong>***</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u26a0\ufe0f Important Update About <i>Necro Siege</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Due to changes in my professional commitments, I\u2019m no longer able to continue active development on the project. Because of this, I\u2019m currently looking for someone to take over development and ownership of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If a suitable developer or publisher isn\u2019t found, <i><strong>Necro Siege</strong></i><strong> will  be removed from sale <i>on or before\u00a0October 28th, 2025.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the meantime, I\u2019ve set the price to the lowest Steam allows, so if you\u2019ve been considering picking it up or want to preserve it in your library, now\u2019s the time. The game will remain fully playable for all existing owners even after it\u2019s removed from sale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If <i>Necro Siege</i> ever returns to development or sale in the future, everyone who already owns it will retain access. Your copy will remain valid regardless of any future ownership or publishing changes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t the way I hoped to close this chapter, but I\u2019m deeply grateful to everyone who supported the game, from early testers to players who fought through the siege and shared their feedback. You helped bring this world to life, and I can\u2019t thank you enough for that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for being part of this journey,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Morgan</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803570/extras/455c8e25f51dcad9041e2282ce10b4ef.avif?t=1760237353\" width=600 height=74 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Necro Siege</strong> is a down and dirty <strong>First-Person Action Horror Shooter</strong> crafted by <strong>one developer</strong> with a love of everything horror and <strong>community-driven development.</strong> In this early stage of development players have the opportunity to <strong>help shape the future of the game.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to <strong>Necro Siege</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world where humanity is on the brink of extinction as otherworldly abominations rise from the shadows</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803570/extras/a78add877ee69e85e8863fbea14ce9ac.poster.avif?t=1760237353\" width=800 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803570/extras/a78add877ee69e85e8863fbea14ce9ac.webm?t=1760237353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803570/extras/a78add877ee69e85e8863fbea14ce9ac.mp4?t=1760237353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience visceral gunplay and  dismemberment. Then get involved and help make this the game you want it to be.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Dark Dystopian Nightmare with no room for humanity.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803570/extras/4abeb28e08d24cacc6bd1923ac79672b.poster.avif?t=1760237353\" width=800 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803570/extras/4abeb28e08d24cacc6bd1923ac79672b.webm?t=1760237353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803570/extras/4abeb28e08d24cacc6bd1923ac79672b.mp4?t=1760237353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Necro Siege</strong>\u00a0journey through forsaken realms confronting eldritch nightmares, zombies, demons, and other horrors in a desperate fight against the end of all things.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803570/extras/d27eb360c35fb8c37ea89b75df7136d2.poster.avif?t=1760237353\" width=800 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803570/extras/d27eb360c35fb8c37ea89b75df7136d2.webm?t=1760237353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803570/extras/d27eb360c35fb8c37ea89b75df7136d2.mp4?t=1760237353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f CORE FEATURES \u2694\ufe0f</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udddf Endless Horde Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face increasingly powerful waves of demonic enemies. The longer you last, the tougher they get. How long can you hold them off?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803570/extras/8757afa8584279ec8f3ec28711cfdf69.poster.avif?t=1760237353\" width=800 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803570/extras/8757afa8584279ec8f3ec28711cfdf69.webm?t=1760237353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803570/extras/8757afa8584279ec8f3ec28711cfdf69.mp4?t=1760237353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Environmental Puzzles &amp; Secrets</strong><br>Explore the ruins of civilization, solve dark puzzles, and uncover hidden areas as you fight to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <strong>Help Shape the Game</strong><br>As an Early Access title developed by a solo dev, your feedback is crucial. Weapon balance, enemy behavior, puzzle design\u2014you can influence it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Solo Dev Passion Project</strong><br>Crafted by one developer with a love for intense survival games and community-driven development.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2803570?t=1760237353","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803570/16ca24921a95faa2a64a5849b0b1bba3bf18755c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760237353","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803570/df36c67fc0c2156f93ced4211e01ea12b9ebe091/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760237353","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803570/df36c67fc0c2156f93ced4211e01ea12b9ebe091/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760237353","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game may include content that is unsuitable for all ages or may not be suitable for viewing in a work environment, such as frequent violence, gore, and general mature themes."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>***PLEASE READ BEFORE PURCHASING</strong>***</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u26a0\ufe0f Important Update About <i>Necro Siege</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Due to changes in my professional commitments, I\u2019m no longer able to continue active development on the project. Because of this, I\u2019m currently looking for someone to take over development and ownership of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If a suitable developer or publisher isn\u2019t found, <i><strong>Necro Siege</strong></i><strong> will  be removed from sale <i>on or before\u00a0October 28th, 2025.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the meantime, I\u2019ve set the price to the lowest Steam allows, so if you\u2019ve been considering picking it up or want to preserve it in your library, now\u2019s the time. The game will remain fully playable for all existing owners even after it\u2019s removed from sale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If <i>Necro Siege</i> ever returns to development or sale in the future, everyone who already owns it will retain access. Your copy will remain valid regardless of any future ownership or publishing changes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t the way I hoped to close this chapter, but I\u2019m deeply grateful to everyone who supported the game, from early testers to players who fought through the siege and shared their feedback. You helped bring this world to life, and I can\u2019t thank you enough for that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for being part of this journey,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Morgan</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803570/extras/455c8e25f51dcad9041e2282ce10b4ef.avif?t=1760237353\" width=600 height=74 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Necro Siege</strong> is a down and dirty <strong>First-Person Action Horror Shooter</strong> crafted by <strong>one developer</strong> with a love of everything horror and <strong>community-driven development.</strong> In this early stage of development players have the opportunity to <strong>help shape the future of the game.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to <strong>Necro Siege</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world where humanity is on the brink of extinction as otherworldly abominations rise from the shadows</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803570/extras/a78add877ee69e85e8863fbea14ce9ac.poster.avif?t=1760237353\" width=800 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803570/extras/a78add877ee69e85e8863fbea14ce9ac.webm?t=1760237353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803570/extras/a78add877ee69e85e8863fbea14ce9ac.mp4?t=1760237353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience visceral gunplay and  dismemberment. Then get involved and help make this the game you want it to be.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Dark Dystopian Nightmare with no room for humanity.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803570/extras/4abeb28e08d24cacc6bd1923ac79672b.poster.avif?t=1760237353\" width=800 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803570/extras/4abeb28e08d24cacc6bd1923ac79672b.webm?t=1760237353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803570/extras/4abeb28e08d24cacc6bd1923ac79672b.mp4?t=1760237353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Necro Siege</strong>\u00a0journey through forsaken realms confronting eldritch nightmares, zombies, demons, and other horrors in a desperate fight against the end of all things.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803570/extras/d27eb360c35fb8c37ea89b75df7136d2.poster.avif?t=1760237353\" width=800 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803570/extras/d27eb360c35fb8c37ea89b75df7136d2.webm?t=1760237353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803570/extras/d27eb360c35fb8c37ea89b75df7136d2.mp4?t=1760237353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f CORE FEATURES \u2694\ufe0f</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udddf Endless Horde Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face increasingly powerful waves of demonic enemies. The longer you last, the tougher they get. How long can you hold them off?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803570/extras/8757afa8584279ec8f3ec28711cfdf69.poster.avif?t=1760237353\" width=800 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803570/extras/8757afa8584279ec8f3ec28711cfdf69.webm?t=1760237353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803570/extras/8757afa8584279ec8f3ec28711cfdf69.mp4?t=1760237353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Environmental Puzzles &amp; Secrets</strong><br>Explore the ruins of civilization, solve dark puzzles, and uncover hidden areas as you fight to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <strong>Help Shape the Game</strong><br>As an Early Access title developed by a solo dev, your feedback is crucial. Weapon balance, enemy behavior, puzzle design\u2014you can influence it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Solo Dev Passion Project</strong><br>Crafted by one developer with a love for intense survival games and community-driven development.</p>","developers":["Krypsis Syndicate"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803570/594359e091d7006f1f29ca43fa33ed19b9dfc26a/header.jpg?t=1760237353","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2803570/162531115/45fe9cbca5046242d04d556c7942e845a696b30e/1750901578/dash_av1.mpd?t=1748709017","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2803570/162531115/45fe9cbca5046242d04d556c7942e845a696b30e/1750901578/dash_h264.mpd?t=1748709017","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2803570/162531115/45fe9cbca5046242d04d556c7942e845a696b30e/1750901578/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1748709017","id":257147472,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257147472/movie480.mp4?t=1748709017","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257147472/movie_max.mp4?t=1748709017"},"name":"Open Beta Gameplay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257147472/be8b9dd518fbe760b2ef2f7aa0dd08d4e84734aa/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1748709017","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257147472/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1748709017","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257147472/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1748709017"}},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2803570/305117875/0aff95